00:15:30.100 --> 00:15:31.600
&gt;&gt; SALLY: Mhm, so was muss spontan kommen.

00:15:31.600 --> 00:15:32.100
&gt;&gt; SARAH: Hm.

00:15:33.900 --> 00:15:34.900
