00:15:34.900 --> 00:15:35.400
&gt;&gt; SALLY: Ja.

00:15:35.400 --> 00:15:35.900
&gt;&gt; SARAH: Gut.

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:38.900
&gt;&gt; SALLY: I'm so excited!

